      "The company name, spelled with a zero. Never translated."
    ],
    [
      "OpenRouter, OpenClaw, Hermes, LoCoMo, GPT-4o, Discord, GitHub",
      "Names of other products and services. Never translated."
    ],
    [
      "Apple, Mac, macOS, Apple Silicon, Intel, Linux, Ubuntu, Windows, PowerShell, MacBook Pro",
      "Platform and hardware names. Never translated; chip names such as Apple M1 stay as Apple writes them."
    ],
    [
      "Python, PyTorch, LoRA, glibc, DMG, SHA-256, sudo, GPU, CPU",
      "Technical names. Never translated."
    ]
